* AE-056/AE-058 DR039 direct-path RC LTspice correlation
.param R_DC={{R_DC}}
.param C_DC={{C_DC}}

VIN IN 0 AC 1
C1 IN OUT {C_DC}
R1 OUT 0 {R_DC}

* Dense sweep is deliberate: the cutoff crossing is compared against the
* closed-form analytical value at microhertz-level absolute tolerance.
.ac dec 2000 0.05 200
.meas AC CORR_RC_FC_HZ WHEN mag(V(OUT))=0.7071067812 CROSS=1
.meas AC CORR_RC_DB_20HZ FIND mag(V(OUT)) AT=20

.end
